{"id":"8ba5a4b6a64820f3","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Nash Equilibrium","display":"df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium — ZFC Game3 Nash Equilibrium","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium — ZFC Game3 Nash Equilibrium","depends_on":["[[./58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium — ZFC Game3 Nash Equilibrium"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a195d25b945b0fa7\" href=\"?note=a195d25b945b0fa7\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md\">58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a195d25b945b0fa7\" href=\"?note=a195d25b945b0fa7\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md\">58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}nash\\text{-}equilibrium} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R)\\land\n\\preccurlyeq_R\\subseteq R\\times R\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in R\\;\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;((\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R\\land\n\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R)\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall t\\in\\vec S(i)\\;\n\\langle\\vec u(i)(\\sigma[i\\mapsto t]),\\vec u(i)(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}nash\\text{-}equilibrium} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R)\\land\n\\preccurlyeq_R\\subseteq R\\times R\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in R\\;\\langle a,a\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b,c\\in R\\;((\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R\\land\n\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R)\\to\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall t\\in\\vec S(i)\\;\n\\langle\\vec u(i)(\\sigma[i\\mapsto t]),\\vec u(i)(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"tar